{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding \u00d7 Sanity Gambit<br>Build your deck on the brink of madness! Each deep-sea catch can be processed into distinct cards - will you craft them or offer as sacrifices? Your choices drastically alter combat tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyssal Expedition<br>Every voyage is a life-or-death gamble. What awaits at the end of your line - precious supplies or unspeakable horrors... Dive deeper or retreat? Remember, your peaceful fishing village is gone forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Relics<br>Ancient artifacts grant game-changing power, but every gift has its price - sometimes costing your sanity, memories, or even parts of your deck...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System Warning<br>Monster attacks drain both HP and SAN. When sanity hits zero, you'll gain &quot;special abilities&quot;... if what remains can still be called &quot;you&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The deepest ocean isn't water, but despair.&quot;<br>When the line trembles again - will you reel in hope, or become the nightmare itself?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837690?t=1757608147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/b4178b0e1a218221d6b3c1ccea69d62267a91e4d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757608147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/44cd2f0c5ca0a39ea2254db6def3a0f7bf23d84a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757608147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/44cd2f0c5ca0a39ea2254db6def3a0f7bf23d84a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757608147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding \u00d7 Sanity Gambit<br>Build your deck on the brink of madness! Each deep-sea catch can be processed into distinct cards - will you craft them or offer as sacrifices? Your choices drastically alter combat tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyssal Expedition<br>Every voyage is a life-or-death gamble. What awaits at the end of your line - precious supplies or unspeakable horrors... Dive deeper or retreat? Remember, your peaceful fishing village is gone forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Relics<br>Ancient artifacts grant game-changing power, but every gift has its price - sometimes costing your sanity, memories, or even parts of your deck...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System Warning<br>Monster attacks drain both HP and SAN. When sanity hits zero, you'll gain &quot;special abilities&quot;... if what remains can still be called &quot;you&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The deepest ocean isn't water, but despair.&quot;<br>When the line trembles again - will you reel in hope, or become the nightmare itself?</p>","developers":[" Little Tiger Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/f65e7ed9664b1f4dc373be787302f88a95daaee7/header.jpg?t=1757608147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196302,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196302/movie480.mp4?t=1757606852","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196302/movie_max.mp4?t=1757606852"},"name":"Lure","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196302/0e5c3030442560540f162c5cdeed305bb6cdd9a0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757606852","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196302/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757606852","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196302/movie_max_vp9.we